# Top-level entries of ~/.claude that tagteam shares between profiles (spec 12.2).
#
# Format, for this file and known-private: one entry per line; blank lines and
# lines starting with '#' are ignored. An entry is a bare file or directory name,
# with no trailing '/', so a directory is listed as "projects", not "projects/".
# Names compare exactly; an entry containing '*' is a glob matched against the
# whole name. No path separators.
projects
history.jsonl
CLAUDE.md
settings.json
keybindings.json
skills
agents
commands
plugins
todos
